flowchart TD
    Policy[Azure Policy Definition] --> Assign[Policy Assignment]
    Assign --> Scope[Subscription / Resource Group Scope]
    Scope --> Eval{Resource Compliant?}
    Eval -- Yes --> Compliant[Compliant]
    Eval -- No --> NonCompliant[Non-Compliant / Flagged]
    NonCompliant --> Remediate[Remediation Task]
